    reintroduced deliberately and the suite caught each:
    
      - background cycle doing a full blocking scan again  -> 4 failures
      - wifi_detail_scan served live on the MQTT thread    -> 2 failures
      - the pending-command check deleted from the scanner -> 2 failures
    
